		<h4>チョコQ アニマテイルズ　日本の動物7</h4>
		<table width="100%">
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2">
				<a href="img/ani_jap7_017.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/ani_jap7_017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/anima/anima_jap7/img/ani_jap7_017.jpg" --></a></td>
			</tr>
